      "content": "but he's so sleepy and hard to wake up right now... i dont wanna rush him to the er if it's just a stomach bug. if i give him the juice and maybe some Pedialyte every hour or so, can i just monitor him at home for a few more hours? i'm really worried about the hospital bill if it's not an emergency",
